## Executive Summary

The Product Department's Objectives and Key Results (OKRs) for 2024 are strategically aligned with MedSync Health's overarching goal of achieving market leadership and preparing for a successful IPO. Our focus is on three core pillars: **Customer Value**, **Platform Scalability**, and **Revenue Growth**.

The department will leverage its FY2024 budget of **AED 34,960,000** and a team of **95** employees to drive product innovation that directly contributes to the company's total FY2024 revenue target of **AED 485,100,000**.

---

## Objectives and Key Results (OKRs)

### Objective 1: Drive Customer Value and Retention through Product Excellence

**Goal:** Ensure our product suite delivers measurable value to customers, leading to high satisfaction and strong revenue retention.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | FY 2024 Target | Q1 Target | Q2 Target | Q3 Target | Q4 Target |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 1.1:** Increase the weighted average product NPS score. | Weighted Avg. NPS | **75** (from 71) | 72 | 73 | 74 | 75 |
| **KR 1.2:** Maintain Net Revenue Retention (NRR) above the baseline. | NRR | **120%** (from 118%) | 118% | 119% | 120% | 120% |
| **KR 1.3:** Increase the number of customer organizations using 3+ products. | Multi-Product Adoption | **1,200** (from 900) | 975 | 1,050 | 1,125 | 1,200 |
| **KR 1.4:** Reduce critical product bugs in production. | Critical Bug Count | **< 5** (from 12) | 10 | 8 | 6 | 5 |

### Objective 2: Establish MedSync as the Most Secure and Scalable Health-Tech Platform

**Goal:** Deliver a robust, high-performance, and compliant platform architecture that supports rapid growth and enterprise-level adoption.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | FY 2024 Target | Q1 Target | Q2 Target | Q3 Target | Q4 Target |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 2.1:** Reduce average API response time for core services. | Avg. API Latency | **< 150ms** (from 250ms) | 220ms | 190ms | 160ms | 150ms |
| **KR 2.2:** Complete the full migration of MedSync Analytics to the new microservices architecture. | Migration Completion | **100%** | 25% | 50% | 75% | 100% |
| **KR 2.3:** Achieve 99.99% uptime for all four core product lines. | Platform Uptime | **99.99%** (from 99.95%) | 99.96% | 99.97% | 99.98% | 99.99% |
| **KR 2.4:** Implement a new data governance framework to ensure compliance with global regulations. | Framework Adoption | **100%** | 25% | 50% | 75% | 100% |

### Objective 3: Accelerate Market Penetration and Revenue Diversification

**Goal:** Launch strategic product features and new offerings that unlock new customer segments and contribute to the company's overall revenue goals.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | FY 2024 Target | Q1 Target | Q2 Target | Q3 Target | Q4 Target |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 3.1:** Increase the total number of unique customer organizations. | Total Customer Orgs | **4,500** (from 3,930) | 4,080 | 4,230 | 4,380 | 4,500 |
| **KR 3.2:** Launch the new "MedSync AI Diagnostics" module (PROD-AI). | Product Launch | **Successful Launch** | Planning | Alpha | Beta | Launch |
| **KR 3.3:** Increase the number of hospitals using MedSync Compliance Suite. | Hospital Compliance Users | **400** (from 280) | 310 | 340 | 370 | 400 |
| **KR 3.4:** Reduce the average time-to-value for new customer onboarding. | Time-to-Value (Days) | **< 20 days** (from 30 days) | 28 | 25 | 22 | 20 |

