## Alignment and Resource Allocation

### Alignment with R&D Investment

The Product Department's OKRs are directly supported by the company's significant investment in Research & Development (R&D), which totals **AED 174,636,000** for FY2024. The focus on platform scalability (O2) and new product development (O3) ensures this investment yields maximum return in terms of product capability and market reach.

### Quarterly Financial Alignment

The quarterly targets for NRR (KR 1.2) and Total Customer Orgs (KR 3.1) are designed to support the company's projected quarterly revenue growth:

| Quarter | Projected Revenue (AED) |
| :--- | :--- |
| Q1 2024 | 110,250,000 |
| Q2 2024 | 117,600,000 |
| Q3 2024 | 124,950,000 |
| Q4 2024 | 132,300,000 |
| **FY 2024 Total** | **485,100,000** |

The Product Department is committed to delivering the product roadmap necessary to achieve these financial results.

